@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il08-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-il08-tax-years`
IMPORT `ito-s47a-definitions`
IMPORT `ito-s47-deduction`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Tests for s 47(b)-(d), the deduction. Row IL-08.
-- Expected values worked by hand from lines 1778-1789 and the 2026 figures (2,268; 116,400; 164,400;
-- 165,228, the same as in ito-il08-tests-s45a-s47.l4); none edited to match the code.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Tests — section 47(b)-(d)`

`the 2026 amounts` MEANS `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year` WITH
    `the amount in section 45A(d)(1)`                                    IS 2268
    `the amount in paragraph (1) of the definition of qualifying income` IS 116400
    `the amount in paragraph (2) of the definition of qualifying income` IS 164400
    `the average wage in the economy, in total for the tax year`         IS 165228

`no sums for section 45A` MEANS `Sums paid in the tax year, for section 45A` OF 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0

-- s 47 sums, positionally:   (b) fund only, (b) State or body, (b1) for the member, (b1) for a child
GIVEN `the year`     IS A NUMBER
      `work`         IS A NUMBER
      `other`        IS A NUMBER
      `insured`      IS A NUMBER
      `deposits`     IS A NUMBER
      `under (b)`    IS A NUMBER
      `under (b1)`   IS A NUMBER
      `regulations`  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47`
`in` `the year` `: work income` `work` `, other income` `other` `, insured income` `insured` `, deposits for him` `deposits` `; paid under (b)` `under (b)` `, under (b1)` `under (b1)` `; within a class of (d):` `regulations` MEANS
    `An individual in a tax year, for sections 45A and 47` WITH
        `tax year`                                                                      IS `the year`
        `an Israeli resident in the tax year`                                           IS TRUE
        `taxable income from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A`     IS `work`
        `taxable income not from work, before the deductions under sections 47 and 47A` IS `other`
        `taxable income from a business or profession`                                  IS `other`
        `insured income`                                                                IS `insured`
        `sums paid in the tax year to a pension provident fund in respect of the individual's income` IS `deposits`
        `sums paid, for section 45A`                                                    IS `no sums for section 45A`
        `sums paid, for section 47`                                                     IS `Sums paid in the tax year, for section 47` OF `under (b)`, 0, `under (b1)`, 0
        `sums deducted under section 47(b) or (b1)`                                     IS 0
        `sums deposited to a pension provident fund as a self-employed member for himself, not credited under section 45A(b)` IS 0
        `a deduction was made for him under section 32(14)(b) for preferred insurance against loss of working capacity`      IS FALSE
        `within a class for which regulations under section 47(d) set higher deductions`                                    IS `regulations`
        `a foreign worker`                                                                                                  IS FALSE

§§ `(b) — not a beneficiary member`

-- Self-employed on 100,000 (no work income), paying 10,000 to a pension fund: not a beneficiary
-- member (10,000 < 26,436.48). Limb (1): 7% of 100,000 = 7,000; 10,000 is not above 12% (12,000).
-- Limb (2): no work income, nil. Deduction 7,000.
#ASSERT `the deduction under section 47 for` (`in` 2026 `: work income` 0 `, other income` 100000 `, insured income` 0 `, deposits for him` 10000 `; paid under (b)` 10000 `, under (b1)` 0 `; within a class of (d):` FALSE) `, at` `the 2026 amounts` EQUALS 7000
-- Paying 14,000: 2,000 above 12%, all within the further 4% (4,000): 9,000.
#ASSERT `the deduction under section 47 for` (`in` 2026 `: work income` 0 `, other income` 100000 `, insured income` 0 `, deposits for him` 14000 `; paid under (b)` 14000 `, under (b1)` 0 `; within a class of (d):` FALSE) `, at` `the 2026 amounts` EQUALS 9000
-- Paying 20,000: 8,000 above 12%, capped at 4,000: 11,000.
#ASSERT `the deduction under section 47 for` (`in` 2026 `: work income` 0 `, other income` 100000 `, insured income` 0 `, deposits for him` 20000 `; paid under (b)` 20000 `, under (b1)` 0 `; within a class of (d):` FALSE) `, at` `the 2026 amounts` EQUALS 11000
-- An employee on 100,000 whose employer pays nothing for him (no insured income), paying 6,000 himself.
-- Limb (1) nil; limb (2) lower of 5% x 100,000 and 5% x 100,000: 5,000. Deduction 5,000.
#ASSERT `the deduction under section 47 for` (`in` 2026 `: work income` 100000 `, other income` 0 `, insured income` 0 `, deposits for him` 6000 `; paid under (b)` 6000 `, under (b1)` 0 `; within a class of (d):` FALSE) `, at` `the 2026 amounts` EQUALS 5000
-- An employee whose 120,000 salary is all insured income: both limbs nil, deduction nil.
#ASSERT `the deduction under section 47 for` (`in` 2026 `: work income` 120000 `, other income` 0 `, insured income` 120000 `, deposits for him` 22200 `; paid under (b)` 7200 `, under (b1)` 0 `; within a class of (d):` FALSE) `, at` `the 2026 amounts` EQUALS 0
-- A beneficiary member has no deduction under (b): E15, 33,300 deposited, 10,800 under (b).
#ASSERT `s 47(b) — the deduction, for` (`in` 2026 `: work income` 180000 `, other income` 0 `, insured income` 180000 `, deposits for him` 33300 `; paid under (b)` 10800 `, under (b1)` 0 `; within a class of (d):` FALSE) `, at` `the 2026 amounts` EQUALS 0

§§ `(b1) — a beneficiary member`

-- Self-employed on 100,000, 30,000 paid for himself (a beneficiary member). (1): 11% of the income
-- for a self-employed member (100,000) = 11,000. (2): additional income nil. Deduction 11,000.
#ASSERT `the deduction under section 47 for` (`in` 2026 `: work income` 0 `, other income` 100000 `, insured income` 0 `, deposits for him` 30000 `; paid under (b)` 0 `, under (b1)` 30000 `; within a class of (d):` FALSE) `, at` `the 2026 amounts` EQUALS 11000
-- Self-employed on 250,000, 60,000 paid for himself. (1): 11% of 116,400 = 12,804. (2): additional
-- income 116,400; the sums (2) can reach: of 47,196 not deducted under (1), what lies above 26,436.48
-- of the 60,000, 33,563.52. Both readings of the 12% test (on 47,196 or on 33,563.52) exceed 13,968,
-- so the limit is 8,148 + 4,656 = 12,804 either way. Deduction 12,804 + 12,804 = 25,608.
#ASSERT `the deduction under section 47 for` (`in` 2026 `: work income` 0 `, other income` 250000 `, insured income` 0 `, deposits for him` 60000 `; paid under (b)` 0 `, under (b1)` 60000 `; within a class of (d):` FALSE) `, at` `the 2026 amounts` EQUALS 25608
-- With 40,000 paid: the sums (2) can reach are 13,563.52, below 12% of 116,400 (13,968); the 27,196
-- not deducted under (1) are above it. The two readings give 8,148 and 12,804 (fork F30): declined.
#ASSERT REFUSED `the deduction under section 47 for` (`in` 2026 `: work income` 0 `, other income` 250000 `, insured income` 0 `, deposits for him` 40000 `; paid under (b)` 0 `, under (b1)` 40000 `; within a class of (d):` FALSE) `, at` `the 2026 amounts` BECAUSE "section 47(b1)(2) does not say whether its 12% test counts the sums its proviso excludes"
#ASSERT `s 47(b1)(1) — the deduction, for` (`in` 2026 `: work income` 0 `, other income` 250000 `, insured income` 0 `, deposits for him` 40000 `; paid under (b)` 0 `, under (b1)` 40000 `; within a class of (d):` FALSE) `, at` `the 2026 amounts` EQUALS 12804

§§ `(d), and the tax years`

#ASSERT REFUSED `the deduction under section 47 for` (`in` 2026 `: work income` 0 `, other income` 100000 `, insured income` 0 `, deposits for him` 10000 `; paid under (b)` 10000 `, under (b1)` 0 `; within a class of (d):` TRUE) `, at` `the 2026 amounts` BECAUSE "the regulations under section 47(d) are not encoded in this model"
#ASSERT REFUSED `the deduction under section 47 for` (`in` 2023 `: work income` 0 `, other income` 100000 `, insured income` 0 `, deposits for him` 10000 `; paid under (b)` 10000 `, under (b1)` 0 `; within a class of (d):` FALSE) `, at` `the 2026 amounts` BECAUSE "row IL-08 does not hold the text of these sections for a tax year before 2024"
